# Release-only: drop BusyBox's wget applet from shipped images.
#
# Nothing on the device uses it - the weather intent fetches over httpx and
# no script in this tree calls wget. It is removed to deny a sealed appliance
# a generic download primitive, which is a standard post-exploitation
# convenience.
#
# Merged only via configs/release.fragment, so dev images keep wget for bench
# work - the same dev/release split used for SSH, the gettys and the serial
# console.
# CONFIG_WGET is not set
